    <briefdescription>
<para>This struct provides a way to check if a given cast is possible. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It provides a static function called isPossible that is used to check if a cast can be performed. It should be overridden like this:</para>
<para>template&lt;&gt; struct <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_cast_is_possible" kindref="compound">CastIsPossible&lt;foo, bar&gt;</ref> { static inline bool isPossible(const bar &amp;b) { return bar.isFoo(); } }; </para>
    </detaileddescription>
